{"data":{"id":"MpCZuWU9e1s","slug":"deborah-cox","title":"Deborah Cox","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"Ipwdk_kzeJg","slug":"its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx","title":"Its over now (Annie Starlight RMX)"},{"id":"CpgGH_Oquhg","slug":"its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx","title":"It's over now (Annie Starlight RMX)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"0A3843oFQUE","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Deborah Cox - Its over now (Annie Starlight RMX)","track":{"id":"Ipwdk_kzeJg","path":"/artists/deborah-cox/tracks/its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx/","slug":"its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx","title":"Its over now (Annie Starlight RMX)","artist":{"slug":"deborah-cox","title":"Deborah Cox"},"artwork":"images/artists/deborah-cox/tracks/its-over-now-annie-starlight-rmx.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"g0WjwIbgFz4","position":56,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Deborah Cox - It's Ove